; PT15 (#951): AutoCAD 2021 lock-position groups from the immutable CC0 drawing
; autocad-attributi.dxf (Matleyx78/dxf-test-file, commit 2aafbb1fa17abc67fdf2ff7de26a34b70e79b736).
; For ATTRIB and ATTDEF SIGLA, the second group 280 is 1; the first remains the version (0).
; The identical round-trip preserves ATTDEF SIGLA.
D = DXF source=autocad-attributi
? count D -> ATTRIB 15; INSERT 3
? roundtrip D -> identical
